と適当ですみませんという感じ","ts":"1626542742.014400","attachments":[{"color":"36a64f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-denops/deno-denops-std/pull/62|#62 :+1: Add Type Definitions for `cursor-functions`\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-denops/deno-denops-std/pull/62|#62 :+1: Add Type Definitions for `cursor-functions`\u003e","text":"全然作業が進んでなくて申し訳ないですが、テストを書いてみたので一度Draft pull requestをしておこうと思います。\n\n• テストの書き方に全く自信がないです\n    • 現状入出力の型に対するテストしか書いていませんが、それでいいのか\n    • ensureで動的にテストをしているが、TypeScript的に型が付いているのかに対するテストも書いた方がいいのか\n    • というのが気になっています\n• `types.ts`に色々生やしているが、この方針でいいのか見て頂きたいです\n\nコミットメッセージや粒度が適当ですが、完成したらrebaseし直す予定です。","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-denops/deno-denops-std|vim-denops/deno-denops-std\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1626542719}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"god","count":2,"users":["U776661HA","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iOUPl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"26188322-52e6-47ee-ac1c-0f09b3b41e4a","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"\u0026gt; So let me ask you, out of the blue, have you ever itched to solve mazes while programming?\n\u0026gt; I never have.\n\u0026gt; In any case, there may be people who love solving mazes and can't get enough of it.\n\u0026gt; So let's try to develop a Denops plugin that can generate and display a maze in vim at any time.\nうまいｗ","ts":"1626540684.014000","edited":{"user":"U776661HA","ts":"1626540724.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"V8d"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f97d8271-f09e-4f93-beed-06c192109a55","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"レビューなどで貢献していただけると幸いです :bow:","ts":"1626535459.013500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"muscle","count":1,"users":["UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"typ